        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia BTB-9009P/415, Back-To-Back Infinity Door Pull Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Infinity Back-to-Back Pull Set is available in oil rubbed bronze, satin nickel, or polished chrome finishes. The Back-To-Back Infinity Door Pull Pair comes packaged as a set of 2 door pulls with the hardware needed to mount them back to back on either side of a single door. This twisted door pull adds a sense of modern appeal to any front door.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Packaged with 2 pulls</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima I 9009P/415 Door Pull Pair:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 16-5/16\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Thickness: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia BTB-9009P Pull is available as a <a href=\"/products/infinity-door-pull-omnia-9009p-415\"><b>Thru-Bolt Mounted Single Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2) Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
